---
description: AiAuN MCP experiment orchestration — ask-first Kaggle runs
alwaysApply: true
---

When running experiments on Kaggle via AiAuN MCP: ask for missing data dir / code version / config; never embed API keys or Drive SA JSON in kernels; call list_runtime_env_files and ask which env file when alternatives exist; use runtime_env_dataset_push(env_file, overrides) to pass secrets on API auto-runs (or run_mode=draft for UI secrets); call preflight_experiment before push; use machine_shape for T4/A100; resolve real slug from push response; classify ERROR with classify_kernel_failure; fill wandb_run via wandb_run_lookup (pass effective WANDB_* from the env pack) after COMPLETE; always show tracking.kaggle_kernel, tracking.wandb_project, tracking.drive_folder to the user.
